# 🌐 API Integration Rule

> **Purpose**: Defines standards and patterns for integrating REST API, GraphQL, and OAuth authentication in test automation.
> Ensures consistent API testing approach with proper layered architecture.

## 📋 Metadata
- **ID**: `api_integration_rule`
- **Name**: API Integration Rule
- **Type**: API Testing & Integration
- **Scope**: All test scenarios requiring API interactions
- **Base Class**: `Engine/Shared/APIHelper.ts`

---

## 🚨 MANDATORY: Layered Architecture for API Integration

> **CRITICAL RULE**: ALL API logic MUST be implemented in Business Workflow layer.
> Test Scenarios MUST ONLY call Business Workflow methods - NO direct API calls in tests.

### **Layered Architecture Requirements**

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    TEST SCENARIO LAYER                              │
│  test/TestScenario/*.test.ts                                        │
│                                                                     │
│  ✅ ALLOWED: Call Business Workflow methods                         │
│  ❌ PROHIBITED: Direct APIHelper usage                              │
│  ❌ PROHIBITED: Direct OAuth/GraphQL/REST calls                     │
│  ❌ PROHIBITED: Import APIHelper class                              │
└───────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┘
                            │
                            ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  BUSINESS WORKFLOW LAYER                            │
│  test/Business/*.ts                                                 │
│                                                                     │
│  ✅ ALLOWED: Use APIHelper for all API operations                   │
│  ✅ ALLOWED: OAuth authentication                                   │
│  ✅ ALLOWED: GraphQL queries and mutations                          │
│  ✅ ALLOWED: REST API calls                                         │
│  ✅ ALLOWED: Token management                                       │
│  ✅ ALLOWED: API response processing                                │
└───────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┘
                            │
                            ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    APIHelper BASE CLASS                             │
│  Engine/Shared/APIHelper.ts                                         │
│                                                                     │
│  • OAuth 2.0 Authentication                                         │
│  • GraphQL Operations                                               │
│  • REST API Operations                                              │
│  • Token Management                                                 │
│  • Request Context Management                                       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### **Call Hierarchy**
**Test Scenario → Business Workflow → APIHelper**

- **(MANDATORY)** Test Scenarios call ONLY Business Workflow methods
- **(MANDATORY)** Business Workflows contain ALL API logic using APIHelper
- **(MANDATORY)** APIHelper provides low-level API operations
- **(PROHIBITED)** Test Scenarios MUST NOT import or use APIHelper directly
- **(PROHIBITED)** Test Scenarios MUST NOT contain OAuth/GraphQL/REST calls

