## 🔒 Security Requirements

### **Credential Management**
- ✅ **NEVER hardcode credentials** in test files or workflows
- ✅ **ALWAYS use SettingsHelper** for API credentials
- ✅ **Configuration source**: ATP_ENVGENE_CONFIGURATION environment variable
  - Structure: `systems[].{systemName}.connections[].HTTP.{param}`
- ✅ **Use environment variables** for sensitive data in CI/CD

### **ATP_ENVGENE_CONFIGURATION Structure**

**Environment variable structure**:
```json
{
  "systems": [
    { 
      "systemName1": { 
        "connections": [{ 
          "HTTP": { 
            "url": "https://app.example.com",
            "username": "login_example",
            "password": "password_example",
            "startPage": "/app" 
          } 
        }] 
      } 
    },
    { 
      "systemName2": { 
        "connections": [{ 
          "HTTP": { 
            "url": "https://api.example.com",
            "tokenEndpoint": "/oauth/token",
            "clientId": "client_id",
            "clientSecret": "client_secret",
            "scope": "openid profile api:read api:write",
            "username": "login_example",
            "password": "password_example"
          } 
        }] 
      } 
    }
  ]
}
```

