## 📊 Logging Standards

### **Logging by Layer**

| Layer | Logger Method | Example |
|-------|---------------|---------|
| Test Scenario | `TestLogger.testStep()` | `'Setup: Create test data via API'` |
| Business Workflow | `TestLogger.businessStep()` | `'Create customer via API'` |
| APIHelper | `TestLogger.baseStep()` | `'POST /api/customers'` |

### **Example Logging Flow**
```
📋 TC Step: Setup: Create test data via API
  🔄 BF: Create customer via API
    ⚙️ Base: POST /api/customers
      ℹ️ Request body: {"name": "Test Customer"...}
      ✓ Response: 201 Created
      ℹ️ Response data keys: id, name, status
    ✓ Customer created: cust_123
  ✓ Test data created successfully
```

